{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13165","headline":"寄江东李判官 · 皇甫冉","name":"寄江东李判官","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"远怀不可道，历稔倦离忧。\n洛下闻新雁，江南想暮秋。\n澄清佐八使，纲纪案诸侯。\n地识吴平久，才当晋用求。\n时贤几殂谢，摛藻继风流。\n更有西陵作，还成北固游。\n归途限尺牍，王事在扁舟。\n山色临湖尽，猿声入梦愁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13165.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13165","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}